0,0,1,228,128ZM40,76H216a12,12,0,0,0,0-24H40a12,12,0,0,0,0,24ZM216,180H40a12,12,0,0,0,0,24H216a12,12,0,0,0,0-24Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"absolute transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 -rotate-90 scale-75\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M208.49,191.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17L128,145,64.49,208.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L111,128,47.51,64.49a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,111l63.51-63.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L145,128Z\"></path></svg></span></button></nav></header><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 md:hidden bg-[#000000] transition-opacity duration-300 overflow-y-auto opacity-0 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#222] bg-[#000000]/95 px-5 py-3.5 backdrop-blur-md\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000]\"><img alt=\"AIBlockList Logo\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/></span><span class=\"font-bold text-white text-base tracking-tight\">AIBlockList</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] text-zinc-300 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M208.49,191.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17L128,145,64.49,208.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L111,128,47.51,64.49a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,111l63.51-63.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L145,128Z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-col px-5 py-5 space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider px-3\">Core Platform</span><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/\"><span>Intelligence</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/account-health\"><span>Health</span></a></div><div class=\"space-y-1 border-t border-[#222] pt-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider px-3\">Resources &amp; Governance</span><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/methodology\"><span>Methodology</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/transparency\"><span>Transparency</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/api-docs\"><span>API &amp; Open Data</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/appeals\"><span>Appeals &amp; Delisting</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/report\"><span>Report Spammer</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/about\"><span>About AIBlockList</span></a></div><div class=\"pt-4 space-y-2.5 border-t border-[#222]\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button-md flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold text-sm\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff6600] animate-pulse\"></span><span>Am I Blocked? Quick Status Check</span></button><a class=\"button-md flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#ff6600] px-4 py-2.5 text-black font-bold text-sm\" href=\"/directory\"><span>Inspect Account Directory</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M204,64V168a12,12,0,0,1-24,0V93L72.49,200.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L163,76H88a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H192A12,12,0,0,1,204,64Z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pt-16 sm:pt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-4 sm:py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 sm:space-y-12\"><div class=\"max-w-[720px]\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] px-3 py-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff6600]\"></span><span class=\"caption-4 font-mono text-zinc-300\">Manifest V3 · Chrome, Brave, Edge &amp; Firefox Supported</span></div><h1 class=\"heading-2 text-white\">AIBlockList Browser Extension</h1><p class=\"body-3 mt-4 text-zinc-400\">Clean social feeds without privacy compromises. Instantly visualizes verified automated spam bots on X and Threads using local-first intelligence — zero telemetry, zero automated clicks, and zero mass-blocking scripts.</p><div class=\"mt-4 sm:mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/aiblocklist-extension-v1.0.0.zip\" download=\"\" class=\"button-md inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#ff6600] px-4 py-2 text-black hover:bg-[#e55c00] font-bold transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M228,144v64a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H40a12,12,0,0,1-12-12V144a12,12,0,0,1,24,0v52H204V144a12,12,0,0,1,24,0Zm-108.49,8.49a12,12,0,0,0,17,0l40-40a12,12,0,0,0-17-17L140,115V32a12,12,0,0,0-24,0v83L96.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,0-17,17Z\"></path></svg><span>Download Extension (.zip)</span></a><span class=\"caption-4 font-mono text-zinc-500\">v1.0.0 · Packaged MV3</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000] text-[#ff6600]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M208,76H180V56A52,52,0,0,0,76,56V76H48A20,20,0,0,0,28,96V208a20,20,0,0,0,20,20H208a20,20,0,0,0,20-20V96A20,20,0,0,0,208,76ZM100,56a28,28,0,0,1,56,0V76H100ZM204,204H52V100H204Zm-76-92a32,32,0,0,0-12,61.66V180a12,12,0,0,0,24,0v-6.34A32,32,0,0,0,128,112Zm0,24a8,8,0,1,1-8,8A8,8,0,0,1,128,136Z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"title-2 text-white\">Local-First &amp; Private</h2><p class=\"body-5 text-zinc-400\">Synchronizes the verified blocklist to your local browser storage once every 6 hours. Your browsing history is never transmitted to our servers.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000] text-[#ff6600]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M208,36H48A20,20,0,0,0,28,56v56c0,54.29,26.32,87.22,48.4,105.29,23.71,19.39,47.44,26,48.44,26.29a12.1,12.1,0,0,0,6.32,0c1-.28,24.73-6.9,48.44-26.29,22.08-18.07,48.4-51,48.4-105.29V56A20,20,0,0,0,208,36Zm-4,76c0,35.71-13.09,64.69-38.91,86.15A126.28,126.28,0,0,1,128,219.38a126.14,126.14,0,0,1-37.09-21.23C65.09,176.69,52,147.71,52,112V60H204ZM79.51,144.49a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0Z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"title-2 text-white\">Account Safety Compliant</h2><p class=\"body-5 text-zinc-400\">Never executes automated DOM clicking or background block scripts that could violate platform terms of service or risk user account restrictions.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000] text-[#ff6600]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M40,92H70.06a36,36,0,0,0,67.88,0H216a12,12,0,0,0,0-24H137.94a36,36,0,0,0-67.88,0H40a12,12,0,0,0,0,24Zm64-24A12,12,0,1,1,92,80,12,12,0,0,1,104,68Zm112,96H201.94a36,36,0,0,0-67.88,0H40a12,12,0,0,0,0,24h94.06a36,36,0,0,0,67.88,0H216a12,12,0,0,0,0-24Zm-48,24a12,12,0,1,1,12-12A12,12,0,0,1,168,188Z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"title-2 text-white\">3 Action Modes</h2><p class=\"body-5 text-zinc-400\">Choose how detected bots appear: subtle warning badges, dimmed reply visibility, or prominent red highlight borders on suspicious comment threads.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"heading-3 text-white\">How It Appears in Social Feeds</h2><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 shrink-0\"></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm\">Tech Influencer</span><span class=\"text-zinc-500 font-mono text-xs\">@creator</span></div><p class=\"body-5 text-zinc-300\">What are the best open source developer tools you discovered this month?</p></div></div><div class=\"ml-8 border-l-2 border-[#272727] pl-4 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 shrink-0\"></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm\">GrowthCrypto_AI</span><span class=\"text-zinc-500 font-mono text-xs\">@growth_bot</span><span class=\"rounded border border-[#ff6600]/50 bg-[#131209] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#ff6600] inline-flex items-center gap-1\">⚠ AI Spam</span></div><p class=\"body-6 text-zinc-400 italic\">[Dimmed / Flagged: Matched SIG-01 near-duplicate copy across 14 unrelated threads]</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"heading-3 text-white\">Quick Installation Guide (Chrome / Brave / Edge)</h2><ol class=\"space-y-4 font-mono caption-4 text-zinc-300 list-decimal list-inside\"><li class=\"p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000]\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Download and extract:</span> Download<!-- --> <a href=\"/aiblocklist-extension-v1.0.0.zip\" class=\"text-[#ff6600] underline\">aiblocklist-extension-v1.0.0.zip</a> <!-- -->and unzip it to a folder.</li><li class=\"p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000]\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Open extensions page:</span> In Chrome or Brave, navigate to <code class=\"text-[#ff6600]\">chrome://extensions</code>.</li><li class=\"p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000]\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Enable Developer Mode:</span> Toggle the switch in the top right corner.</li><li class=\"p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000]\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Load Unpacked:</span> Click &quot;Load unpacked&quot; and select the extracted extension folder.</li></ol></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-8 sm:mt-10 pb-6 sm:pb-8\"><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1a1a1a] to-[#121212] px-4 py-5 sm:px-8 sm:py-10\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#ff6600]/50 to-transparent\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Scroll to top\" class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 sm:top-7 sm:right-7 rounded-xl border border-[#313131] bg-[#1F1F1F] p-2 text-zinc-400 hover:border-[#ff6600]/60 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,168.49a12,12,0,0,1-17,0L128,97,56.49,168.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17l80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17,0l80,80A12,12,0,0,1,216.49,168.49Z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-10 mb-4 sm:mb-6 md:mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start max-w-sm space-y-2.5 pr-12 md:pr-0\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000] p-1.5 group-hover:border-[#ff6600]/60 transition-colors duration-300\"><img alt=\"AIBlockList Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/></div><span class=\"title-2 font-mono text-white tracking-tight\">AIBlockList<span class=\"text-[#ff6600]\">.</span></span></a><p class=\"text-[13px] leading-relaxed sm:body-6 text-zinc-400 text-pretty\">Independent, open source trust infrastructure separating automated reply spam from authentic human speech across 𝕏 and Threads.</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] sm:caption-5 font-mono text-zinc-400 whitespace-nowrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-emerald-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M208,36H48A20,20,0,0,0,28,56v56c0,54.29,26.32,87.22,48.4,105.29,23.71,19.39,47.44,26,48.44,26.29a12.1,12.1,0,0,0,6.32,0c1-.28,24.73-6.9,48.44-26.29,22.08-18.07,48.4-51,48.4-105.29V56A20,20,0,0,0,208,36Zm-4,76c0,35.71-13.09,64.69-38.91,86.15A126.28,126.28,0,0,1,128,219.38a126.14,126.14,0,0,1-37.09-21.23C65.09,176.69,52,147.71,52,112V60H204ZM79.51,144.49a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0Z\"></path></svg><span>Apache 2.0 · ODC-By 1.0 · Policy v1</span></div></div><div class=\"sm:hidden w-full rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#141414] divide-y divide-[#272727]\"><details open=\"\" class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between px-3.5 py-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-300\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff6600]\"></span>Platform<span class=\"text-zinc-600\">4</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-zinc-500 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></summary><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 px-2.5 pb-3\"><li><a class=\"flex h-full items-center justify-between gap-1 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#1c1c1c] px-2.5 py-2 text-[12.5px] leading-tight text-zinc-300 active:border-[#ff6600]/60 active:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/\"><span>Intelligence feed</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"shrink-0 text-zinc-600\"><path d=\"M204,64V168a12,12,0,0,1-24,0V93L72